WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — communication-avalanche (ig) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:10.161
<v Narrator>Ọrụ mbụ, site na microbes ochie ruo AI nke ugbu a, ndị otu na-emelite site n'ịkekọrịta akara site na ịdị elu dị ala na ụzọ nchekwa.

2
00:00:10.241 --> 00:00:19.587
<v Narrator>Nke abụọ, ihe omume-na-adọta wekpe na ndenye nnyocha na-egbochi mmegharị ọjọọ ma nyefee ọrụ ndị ọzọ ekwenyelarị per joule.

3
00:00:19.667 --> 00:00:27.390
<v Narrator>N'ihi ya, ọ bụrụ na a bịa n'ihe gbasara ịrụ ọrụ nke ọma, ihe ndị dị mkpa ga-adịkarị ka ha na-arụ ọrụ.
